"**What happened**\n\n(what you saw, and what you expected)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. \n\n**Setup**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 build %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, %lu display(s)\n\n<details><summary>Diagnostics</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n" = "**Was passiert ist**\n\n(was du gesehen hast, und was du erwartet hättest)\n\n**Schritte**\n\n1. \n\n**Umgebung**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 Build %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, %lu Display(s)\n\n<details><summary>Diagnose</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n";
